{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Precision strategy, real-time duels\u2014command your AI squad in a relentless arena!&quot;</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180830/extras/975bb6e33e10720434268410a30861a0.poster.avif?t=1772093378\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180830/extras/975bb6e33e10720434268410a30861a0.webm?t=1772093378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180830/extras/975bb6e33e10720434268410a30861a0.mp4?t=1772093378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circuit Stance</strong> is a competitive strategy game that blends creativity and tactical depth, designed for players who love to think, optimize, and win. Step into the role of a post-apocalyptic super AI, programming your robot squad to secure resources and dominate the battlefield.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan your strategy, program your destiny!</strong><br>Utilize the modular chip system to craft unique AI behaviors for your robots. Test, refine, and unleash the ultimate strategies in battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast iterations, tactical supremacy!</strong><br>Circuit Stance offers quick yet complex turn-based matches, letting you experience the full cycle of experimentation to mastery in minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only winners survive the arena!</strong><br>With a unique tiered scoring system, each victory propels your rank upward, while losses bring challenges. Every match counts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized flat anime aesthetics!</strong><br>Featuring sleek, futuristic designs and vibrant 2D visuals, Circuit Stance offers a seamless blend of strategy and style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who is this game for?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180830/extras/afa6eae645a5e022f4029749fc36a062.poster.avif?t=1772093378\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180830/extras/afa6eae645a5e022f4029749fc36a062.webm?t=1772093378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180830/extras/afa6eae645a5e022f4029749fc36a062.mp4?t=1772093378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who thrive on deep strategy, optimization, and quick tactical challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who dislike time management and prefer jumping straight into the action</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180830/extras/27a99e0097f324ef08b073e9790403c5.poster.avif?t=1772093378\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180830/extras/27a99e0097f324ef08b073e9790403c5.webm?t=1772093378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180830/extras/27a99e0097f324ef08b073e9790403c5.mp4?t=1772093378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Tactical Programming</strong>: Design and deploy robot AI chip actions to create diverse tactical builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Risk, High-Reward Competitions</strong>: Push your ranking higher with each win or face the challenge of starting over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iterative Strategy Testing</strong>: Experiment, optimize, and validate your tactics in fast-paced matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flat Anime Art Style</strong>: Lightweight but futuristic visuals make every duel visually dynamic and strategic.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3180830?t=1772093378","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772093378","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180830/f7da7cabfe6d1908c77ff4a5e92058817575f865/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772093378","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180830/f7da7cabfe6d1908c77ff4a5e92058817575f865/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772093378","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4307510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Welcome to our community! </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180830/extras/aeb6d5d5d265c1b22b282d56ca326d91.avif?t=1772093378\" width=780 height=304 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Precision strategy, real-time duels\u2014command your AI squad in a relentless arena!&quot;</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s